          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தடுப்பூசி (taṭuppūci) is a Tamil compound: தடுப்பு, from native தடு taṭu, \"to stop\" (DEDR 3031), and ஊசி, \"a needle\", borrowed from Sanskrit sūcī (CDIAL 13551)."
            }
